{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/transitionstream(bufferingpolicy:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/transitionStream(bufferingPolicy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a stream of the transitions made from now on, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order they are made."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"transitionStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TransitionStream","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/TransitionStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C16TransitionStreama"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Continuation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferingPolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO"},{"text":" = .unbounded) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TransitionStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/TransitionStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C16TransitionStreama"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"bufferingPolicy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How transitions are buffered until they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are consumed. By default all of them, without any limit."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new stream of transitions."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every call creates a new stream, independent of all other streams."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Several consumers can each have a stream of their own, and all of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them get every transition. Cancelling the task of a consumer, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"letting go of a stream, ends only that stream.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stream finishes when the state machine reaches an ending state,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after the transition leading there, as no further transitions will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be made. A stream created at an ending state is finished from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"start. The stream also finishes if the state machine is deallocated."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create the stream before processing the events of interest, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand it over to the task consuming it. A stream created by a new"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"task misses the transitions made before the task starts running.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["let transitions = await stateMachine.transitionStream()","","Task {","    for await transition in transitions {","        print(transition)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the transition received, and not ","type":"text"},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", to know the state","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entered. The state machine may have moved on since the transition.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"transitionStream(bufferingPolicy:)","modules":[{"name":"MiamiStateMachine"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"transitionStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TransitionStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C16TransitionStreama"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Continuation","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C16TransitionStreama","text":"TransitionStream"}],"externalID":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C16transitionStream15bufferingPolicyScSyAA15TransitionEventVyxq_GGScS12ContinuationV09BufferingG0OyAH__G_tF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"references":{"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A state machine is an actor with a current state and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a set of transitions defining the machine. The "},{"code":"TransitionRule","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connects two states by an event trigger.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"StateMachine","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StateMachine","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine","fragments":[{"tex